{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/extras/2b85f4751b67319523a56c940bcd683c.webp?t=1759841299\" width=780 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mining visual novel that delves deep into a snow-covered mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your equipment by digging deeper and reflect on the events that brought you here in the first place.\u00a0\u00a0Let this heartwarming journey fill you with flashes of accomplishment on those sleepless nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/extras/a161cb763d473d1ab96b0259dbb64cb3.poster.avif?t=1759841299\" width=780 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/extras/a161cb763d473d1ab96b0259dbb64cb3.webm?t=1759841299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/extras/a161cb763d473d1ab96b0259dbb64cb3.mp4?t=1759841299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/extras/524d016542b79c4f4aaa2ca6658ae392.webp?t=1759841299\" width=780 height=47 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining Game x Visual Novel: </strong>The deeper you dig, the more of the story you'll uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Mining: </strong>Progress at a pleasant pace by gradually upgrading your equipment, and enjoy the satisfying sound effects of collecting new ores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Brief Respite: </strong>The demo offers a brief five-minute glimpse. The full game can be comfortably completed in about two hours. Soothe your mind with the game's mellow music and story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/extras/d97203b9cea5d099e28b403234250108.avif?t=1759841299\" width=780 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/extras/850cc8cdc441a8faf8d7fd729fdf0398.webp?t=1759841299\" width=780 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The start of a long and brutally cold winter heralds a changing of monarchs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Winter Kingdom Isenvindar holds a succession ceremony in those years marked by unusually harsh winters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three siblings stand as potential successors this time: the eldest, a cheerful wanderer; the second, a stern swordsman; and the youngest, a wise and kind soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who shall bring an end to this winter and claim the throne?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/extras/c4e4ba11118d0e5e16b65870ece04abe.avif?t=1759841299\" width=1560 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585190?t=1759841299","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/5702a060784f97864d35266d70f119e547081fb0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759841299","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585190/c9a9c9b82de7d51e30ae6c170c84c49ed3733fee/capsule_231x87.jp